b","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"77319","synopsis":"司府诚招杂役一名，男女不限，桃夭就此开启打工之旅，不过为何众人都说司府不是什么好地方？ 在司府的小妖怪云阳的登场，又会带来什么样的故事？ 桃夭司府打工的初体验似乎并没有那么顺利，喂马的工作也并没有那么轻松，好在有丁三四的帮忙，共同应对这份工作。 「秀色可餐」的司府二少爷司狂澜首次登场，他与桃夭之间又会有着怎样的故事？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kFPCMN8EC2CxntlbW1YKMDxdK2f.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"77320","synopsis":"云阳求桃夭帮忙给丁三四一个礼物，但却要云阳付出巨大的代价，这个礼物又与二少爷司狂澜有着什么样的联系？ 口是心非的桃夭在得知云阳与丁三四的过往后，答应请求加入圆梦小分队。 一会儿是牵线人，一会儿是送药君，甚至化为人形吹风机，看来桃夭的额外技能属性又增加了呀。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gI6SRc0suG4Tucz3PSuZkunQNCR.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"77321","synopsis":"司府大少爷司静渊为何会被抬回府邸？ 虚耗与大少爷之间又会发生什么样的故事？ 在桃夭的帮助下，司静渊终于醒来，不料却言语行为如女子，还自称岳平川。 司狂澜迫于无奈答应了桃夭的要求，两人终于一起前往岳家探个究竟。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/md2ZlvfB3GN30ZcyN2RjLi7rTXy.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"77322","synopsis":"原来，岳平川是被一种叫虚耗的妖怪窃取欢心，桃夭和司狂澜能否消灭虚耗？ 自桃夭喜提打工人和牵线人称号之后，一个新的「查案人」称号也安排上了，桃夭联合司狂澜前往岳家巧妙破局，消灭恶妖虚耗的同时，司静渊和岳平川也脱离了危险，真是妙哉。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3liBYs2vmKZcQvm5cYi0Kt0l6N8.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"77323","synopsis":"百妖谱记载，西极有云，云后有龙雀，似鸟似风，传为初风之子。 这龙雀为何会出现在司府厨房？ 性情各异的桃都一行人与司家兄弟能和平相处吗？ 凭借桃夭这个关系户进府的桃都一行人很快就安顿下来，司府也平添了不少烟火气息。 只是，前有柳公子炸厨房做饭，后有桃夭买古董被骗......","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jT4VYTVqVIRHAEDTVpMKHRuZDcu.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"77324","synopsis":"自由自在的风神化身龙雀，因为一起事故被合成为阿龙的菜刀。 张伯与阿龙之间有哪些渊源？ 他的菜刀又为何会伴随张伯这么多年？ 真是一波未平一波又起，桃夭被骗之事还没着落，官府又因为兴祥斋老板一案跑到司府来拿人。 老张的过去总算画上了句号，只是换成了柳大厨，今后这司府的厨房怕是保不住了。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mtznet6gKA1ZAyHQZcgiiWclgDN.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"77325","synopsis":"世事难料啊，老张走后这司府的厨房居然被柳公子接替了，连司狂澜都忍不住亲自下厨，只是苦了磨牙，为了一口吃的，竟然住进了鬼屋。 磨牙和滚滚意外住进鬼屋，遇到一只奇怪的小妖怪，一心只想和人牵牵手，磨牙与小妖怪傒囊之间会发生什么故事？ 桃夭又能否医好得了怪病的傒囊？","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/35uMiQ9t8OzoTZ3CcBJpKuOdVvb.jpg"},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":3,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope":"s3","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"77326","synopsis":"傒囊终于等到了罗喜喜的赴约，她给它做饭，带它一起逛京师，可是磨牙却哭着说「一定是哪里出错了」，究竟这背后还有哪些隐情？ 磨牙从桃夭口中得知，娃娃是一只傒囊，并且一离开住地就会死，桃夭一行人忍着难过，多番努力下终于替它实现了关于罗喜喜的心愿。","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9pBofpUaRtvTdvheNFzJ1Gg6ReT.jpg"}],"sourceIds":{"anilistId":141866,"malId":50537},"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3","schemaVersion":"3.0.3","generatedOn":"2026-10-29T07:54:59Z","sourceDescriptors":["anilist:141866","mal:50537"],"targets":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"17535","scope":"R","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"anilist","id":"141866","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"mal","id":"50537","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"101099","scope":"s3","ranges":{"1-12":"1-12"}},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"381536","scope"